* {{rhymes|en|iːmə|s=4}}

===Noun===
{{en-noun|~|s|emphysemata}}

# {{lb|en|pathology}} An abnormal [[accumulation]] of [[air]] or other [[gas]] in [[tissue]]s, most commonly the [[lung]]s.
# {{lb|en|medicine}} [[pulmonary emphysema|Pulmonary emphysema]], a chronic lung disease, one type of [[chronic obstructive pulmonary disease]].
#* {{quote-journal|en|date=2015-06-05|author=Geeta Shroff|title=Human embryonic stem cells (hESCs) in the treatment of emphysematous COPD: a case report|journal=Clinical Case Reports|url=http://www.ncbi.nlm.nih.gov/pmc/articles/PMC4527812/|doi=10.1002/ccr3.310|volume=3|issue=|pages=
|passage=The panacinar '''emphysema''' shows higher compliance with lungs then the centriacinar '''emphysema''' 5 .}}

